# Rivals (bastok 20): Detzo in Bastok Mines. The guard (Bastok fame level 3), the Mythril Sallet trade (borrowed: the
# finish completes the quest but takes no item), the message while accepted, the Wolf Gorget reward, no repeat.
# Detzo's default is 30; The Talekeeper's Gift and mission 8-2 also name him, and this char (a WAR 1 with no missions)
# meets neither.
lists BastokMines/Detzo/onTrigger BastokMines/Detzo/onTrade BastokMines/onEventFinish/93 BastokMines/onEventFinish/94
char zone=BastokMines pos=5.4,6.999,10.9
fame Bastok 124
item MythrilSallet
item BoneChip
login
trade Detzo MythrilSallet x1    # available: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Detzo                   # fame 124 (level 2): his default 30
finish
fame Bastok 125
trigger Detzo                   # fame level 3: the offer, 93
finish                          # accepted
trigger Detzo                   # accepted: DETZO_RIVALS_DIALOG (messageName)
trade Detzo BoneChip x1         # the wrong item: nothing
trade Detzo MythrilSallet x1    # 94
finish                          # completed: Wolf Gorget, fame +30, Contest Rigger; the sallet kept (no tradeComplete)
trigger Detzo                   # completed: 30
finish
trade Detzo MythrilSallet x1    # completed: nothing
